---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Client.Ultra 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shrink-0 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/client-ultra.webp`} alt="Client.Ultra" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">Client.Ultra 评测</h1>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">7.3</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30">住宅代理</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">ULTRA ONE · 0欺诈分住宅代理 · HTTPS/SOCKS5 · 无限带宽</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">核心摘要</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">代理类型</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">住宅 / 邮件 / IPv6</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">运营商合作</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">Verizon / AT&T / Cox Business</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">核心特性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">0欺诈分 · HTTPS/SOCKS5 · 无限带宽 · 双认证</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">运营年限</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">7年+</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">品牌与平台概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          ULTRA ONE Telecommunications 是一家拥有 7 年以上经验的电信级代理服务商，与 Verizon、AT&T、Cox Business 等美国主流 ISP 有直接合作关系。通过 client.ultra.one 客户端门户提供住宅代理、邮件代理、IPv6 代理等服务。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          核心卖点为 0 欺诈分住宅 IP，所有代理均为真实 ISP 提供的 IP 地址。支持 HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，提供用户/密码和 IP 白名单双认证方式，无限带宽，10/40Gbps 网络端口。还提供网关服务器、VPN、RDP 等增值服务。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">支付与使用</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">运营商直连</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">住宅代理（静止/轮换）</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">邮件代理（所有端口开放）</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">0 欺诈分 IP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">无限带宽 / 不限速</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">2小时内快速交付</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">平台特性</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">0 欺诈分</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">所有住宅 IP 均为零欺诈分数，经过严格筛选，适合高严格度的广告验证和账号注册场景。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">运营商直连</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">与 Verizon、AT&T、Cox Business 等美国主要 ISP 直接合作，IP 来源纯正，非 P2P 采集。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">双协议 + 双认证</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持 HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，提供用户/密码和 IP 白名单两种认证方式，灵活适配各种环境。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">邮件代理专用</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">专门提供邮件代理方案，支持反向 DNS，所有邮件端口开放，适合邮件营销和验证。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>0 欺诈分住宅 IP 纯净度高</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>与 Verizon/AT&T 运营商直连</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无限带宽 / 10-40Gbps 端口</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>邮件代理端口全开</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>主要面向美国 IP</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>价格信息不透明</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌知名度较低</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          ULTRA ONE 是一家与美国主流 ISP 有直接合作关系的电信级代理服务商，提供 0 欺诈分的纯净住宅 IP。支持 HTTPS 和 SOCKS5，无限带宽，10-40Gbps 网络端口，性能表现突出。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          邮件代理的全端口开放是其差异化优势。主要局限在于主要覆盖美国地区，价格信息不够透明。综合评估，Client.Ultra 获得 7.3 分评价。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://client.ultra.one/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 Client.Ultra
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
